desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "System Wildcard Detected"
	title_zh: "检测到系统调用中的通配符注入",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-system-wildcard-detected"
	risk: "Security"
	desc: <<<DESC
Migrated from Semgrep rule `system-wildcard-detected` (/tmp/semgrep-rules/python/lang/security/audit/system-wildcard-detected.yaml).
Original message: Detected use of the wildcard character in a system call that spawns a shell. This subjects the wildcard to normal shell expansion, which can have unintended consequences if there exist any non-standard file names. Consider a file named '-e sh script.sh' -- this will execute a script when 'rsync' is called.

CWE: CWE-155: Improper Neutralization of Wildcards or Matching Symbols
References:
- https://www.defensecode.com/public/DefenseCode_Unix_WildCards_Gone_Wild.txt
- https://github.com/PyCQA/bandit/blob/b1411bfb43795d3ffd268bef17a839dee954c2b1/bandit/plugins/injection_wildcard.py
Note: context-aware regex — wildcard hits are kept only inside os.system/os.popen*/subprocess(..., shell=True) call regions (pattern-either of pattern-inside, OR via union).
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
Avoid passing wildcards to shell-spawning system calls; use argument lists (e.g. subprocess.run([...])) instead of shell strings.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.py": <<<POS
import os as o
import subprocess as subp

o.system("/bin/tar xvzf YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-system-wildcard-detected")
subp.Popen('/bin/chown *', shell=True)
POS
	"safefile://neg.py": <<<NEG
import subprocess as subp

subp.Popen('/bin/rsync *')
subp.Popen(['/bin/chown', '*'])
o.spawnvp(os.P_WAIT, 'tar', ['tar', 'xvzf', '*'])
NEG
)

${*.py}.pattern_regex(/\b(?:os|o)\.(?:system|popen|popen2|popen3|popen4)\s*\([^)]*\)/) as $c1
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/\b(?:subprocess|subp)\.\w+\s*\([^)]*shell\s*=\s*True[^)]*\)/) as $c2
$c1 + $c2 as $c
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/(?:tar|chmod|chown|rsync)(?:.*?)\*|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-system\-wildcard\-detected/) as $t
$t inside $c as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "System Wildcard Detected",
	title_zh: "检测到系统调用中的通配符注入",
	message: "Detected use of the wildcard character in a system call that spawns a shell.",
}
